Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 14:15:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: lock screen fixes from real hardware

- The sign-in layer always covers the whole screen, also after the screen
  reports its size again (upstream's 800 px box left a blurred square in
  the middle with nothing in it). znraznra/lapin-ux#1
- Account pictures are cut to a circle when loaded, so they're round
  whatever their shape. znraznra/lapin-ux#4
- Battery icon: standard battery-level names first, COSMIC's as the
  fallback. znraznra/lapin-ux#3
- The touch keyboard button starts cosmic-osk if it isn't running (Lapin UX
  starts it on demand). znraznra/lapin-ux#2
